		(descr "Analog Devices LTC4368-1: 2.5-60 V UV/OV and reverse-supply protection controller with bidirectional electronic circuit breaker. Drives back-to-back external N-channel MOSFETs. Forward sense threshold +50 mV, reverse -50 mV (-1 option). GATE charge pump 35 uA pull-up, up to 13.1 V enhancement, referenced to VOUT. 2.2 V VIN UVLO. Pin-selectable overcurrent auto-retry timer or latch-off. THE -1 SUFFIX IS LOAD-BEARING: the -2 trips at -3 mV and blocks normal charging.")
		(tags "MSOP SO TSSOP-10_3x3mm_P0.5mm")
